  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>We know that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mfenced><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mfenced><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
